Return shipping insurance purchased at checkout settles automatically when a return happens — no separate claim is needed.

Claim rules: shipping insurance pays at most 25 CNY; any freight above that is borne by you. The payout is returned to your original payment method after the return is completed.

Common questions:
(1) For uninsured returns, return shipping depends on the reason — covered by the platform for quality issues, borne by the buyer for no-reason returns;
(2) The payout may differ from the actual postage you paid; claims follow the rate table agreed between the platform and the insurer;
(3) If you disagree with the payout, contact online customer service with your order number for a review.
